                                "sense_id": "4344d2b5-2b24-36a6-868e-90b9ae0c2d79",
                                "text": "And with that, Hannibal leaves his enemies on the floor bathing in their own scarlet before stepping outside to a renewing baptism by rainfall before disappearing into the night."
